      "@type": "mira:Evidence",
      "schema:name": "arcuate-body-layers-neurotransmitter-distinguished",
      "schema:description": "Co-staining with multiple neurotransmitter markers allows the arcuate body layers to be distinguished morphologically, where single-channel synapsin staining is insufficient to differentiate the layers.",
